# Trivy Ignore File
# Plain-format rules for ad-hoc scanners. Vulnerability suppressions are not kept
# here: each needs an owner and an expiry in .trivyignore.yaml, and CI reads that
# file. The filesystem gate reports unfixed CVEs (TRIVY_IGNORE_UNFIXED=false); only exact
# dispositions in .trivyignore.yaml suppress them. Misconfiguration rules live in the YAML file.
#
# AUD-245: no KSV rule is kept here. Every KSV misconfiguration exception is path-scoped
# in .trivyignore.yaml with a reason and an expiry (ADR-047 addendum, 2026-11-04).
